Flow Down
group Shipping "Shipping" in -
node start "" circle
node Draft "Draft" rounded
node Review "In review" rounded
node Shipping-start "" circle group="Shipping"
node Packed "Packed" rounded group="Shipping"
node Sent "Sent" rounded group="Shipping"
node Shipping-end "" circle group="Shipping"
node check "" diamond
node Done "Done" rounded
node Lost "Lost" rounded sub="investigate with the carrier"
node end "" circle
edge e0 start -> Draft Solid none..arrow
edge e1 Draft -> Review Solid none..arrow "submit"
edge e2 Review -> Draft Solid none..arrow "changes"
edge e3 Review -> Shipping-start Solid none..arrow "approve"
edge e4 Shipping-start -> Packed Solid none..arrow
edge e5 Packed -> Sent Solid none..arrow
edge e6 Sent -> Shipping-end Solid none..arrow
edge e7 Shipping-end -> check Solid none..arrow
edge e8 check -> Done Solid none..arrow "delivered"
edge e9 check -> Lost Solid none..arrow "no scan"
edge e10 Done -> end Solid none..arrow
